''batch_size'': {
    ''values'': [16, 32, 64, 128, 256]
}

# Integer uniform
''num_layers'': {
    ''distribution'': ''int_uniform'',
    ''min'': 2,
    ''max'': 10
}

# Quantized uniform (step size)
''layer_size'': {
    ''distribution'': ''q_uniform'',
    ''min'': 32,
    ''max'': 512,
    ''q'': 32  # Step by 32: 32, 64, 96, 128...
}

# Quantized log-uniform
''hidden_size'': {
    ''distribution'': ''q_log_uniform'',
    ''min'': 32,
    ''max'': 1024,
    ''q'': 32
}
```

### Categorical Parameters

